  message: "Ruled by the owner 2026-11-23 (\"yes to both, in the same bump\") and built in PR #2354 (dev 39bef1108): Fennel, Gleam, Hack, Haxe, Janet, Odin, Prisma, Tcl and V hash Symbol.kind, and the wrong kinds are corrected.\nRE-RUN on dev 39bef1108 (hypergumbo run on the nine-language fixture, closure/t/lilab, against dev 05ed6f5fe): the stable ids of the role-word symbols moved (e.g. Prisma block db 0ad1852a87d2a1a4 to b82b2487ee801d6d, Haxe Shape.area 430ba7c2b3f6bdbc to ffcdb9f1f05b8e13, Fennel add 9a882b3f12fc73fe to 8bba7fe689ce16f1); reported kinds on 39bef1108: Gleam Shape and Person type, Size type_alias; Odin Point struct, Value union; V Point struct, Num union, norm (a function with a receiver) method. packages/hypergumbo-lang-extended1/tests/test_stable_id_hashes_symbol_kind.py runs each of the nine analyzers and asserts the id is the formula over Symbol.kind.\nMEASURED by the builder: thirteen Prisma schemas 185 of 197 ids moved (enums kept), git-gui Tcl 166 of 166 procs. No Fennel, Gleam, Hack, Haxe, Janet, Odin or V source is in the corpus: those seven are fixture only.\nLEFT: a Prisma model stays kind class. NOT FIXED, filed: WI-rirab-famur-sivod-pukod-ruhal-fahif-mupah-barun (no contains edge for a type_alias, typedef or alias: a Gleam alias lost its file edge with the kind correction), WI-mokuh-hifih-bofod-rular-sagot-bidit-filup-ginim (V selector calls, V method containment), WI-lorit-dikih-goduv-lubok-zosib-rikuh-patip-huhuh (Prisma datasource and generator of one name, Elm alias kind, no static guard); the Prisma model question is in WI-siror-bupaz-zofiz-jomam-jimim-komoh-vavad-sirar.\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/closure/ (out_dev.txt = dev 39bef1108 after the merge, out_base.txt = dev 05ed6f5fe before it; repro trees t/, run.sh, q.py, presplit.py)."  # 982d
